_🎯 Functional Correctness_ | _🟡 Minor_ | _⚡ Quick win_

**Treat null and empty balances as unknown.**

`Number( null )` and `Number( '' )` produce zero, contradicting the documented em-dash fallback and misrepresenting unavailable balances as `$0.00`.

<details>
<summary>Proposed fix</summary>

```diff
 function formatWalletAmount( micros ) {
+	if ( micros === null || micros === undefined || micros === '' ) {
+		return '—';
+	}
 	const amount = Number( micros );
```
</details>

