**Cache a rejected registration promise forever with no retry path.**

Unlike `ensureRegistered()` in `src/abilities/index.js` (which resets its caches to `null` when registration can't complete, explicitly to allow retry), this function never clears `window[THEME_COMPLETION_REGISTRATION_KEY]` on failure. If the chained promise rejects even once, the completion-gate validator ability is permanently unregistered for the page's lifetime, and the module-load self-invocation at Line 38 becomes an unhandled promise rejection.



