**Apply the onboarding merge when the stored list is empty.**

Because this block is nested under the non-empty check, an enabled built-in onboarding row persisted with `tier_1_tools: []` skips all six required tools and omits `options['tier_1_tools']`. Move the onboarding normalization outside that guard, then add the option only when the final list is non-empty.






