<summary>🛡️ Proposed fix</summary>

```diff
-	dispatcher.replaceBlocks( current.clientIds, parsed.blocks );
+	try {
+		dispatcher.replaceBlocks( current.clientIds, parsed.blocks );
+	} catch ( _error ) {
+		return { applied: 'unknown', reason: 'dispatch_failed' };
+	}
```
</details>

