**Use camelCase for the timeout callback variable.**

Line 356 introduces `$timeout_filter`. The PHP path rule requires camelCase variables. Rename it to `$timeoutFilter` at registration and removal so both calls retain the same callback identity.

<details>
<summary>Proposed fix</summary>

```diff
