@coderabbitai Implemented in 8ad52194. `search()` and `get_image()` now preserve absent licence metadata as empty values and return the API-provided licence URL when present. The local `$license_url` name remains snake_case to satisfy the repository PHP standard.

Verified with `composer phpcs -- includes/Abilities/ImageSources/WikimediaImageSource.php`, `php -l includes/Abilities/ImageSources/WikimediaImageSource.php`, and `pnpm run test:php -- --filter=ImageSourceFactoryTest` (9 tests, 36 assertions).

